# FIGURES 6 AND 7: IRS-ASSISTED SECRET KEY GENERATION
# ============================================================
#
# Objective:
# Evaluate the conditional mutual information between
# legitimate backscatter tags in the presence of an
# eavesdropper under two observation models.
#
# Figure 6:
# Secret-key-rate proxy versus SNR for eavesdropper
# observation model 1.
#
